om-cinema-4d-beta-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"exteriors-sky-weather-fog-and-ground\">Exteriors — sky, weather, fog and ground<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#exteriors-sky-weather-fog-and-ground\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p><em>A villa, a tower, a street: an exterior needs a sky over it, ground under\nit and, when the pitch calls for it, weather. The exterior kit (2.7) adds\nall three to any scene, on every device, without a recompile.</em></p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-get\">What you get<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-you-get\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Feature</th><th>What it does</th><th>Where it works</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Physical sky</strong></td><td>A daylight dome (Preetham model) placed by the <strong>Sun</strong> panel: noon is blue, evening warm, the horizon hazes with turbidity. Its light also fills live-lit surfaces (the ambient follows the sun). A procedural cloud layer with coverage and density scrolls with the wind.</td><td>WebGPU and WebGL2. Baked (lightmapped) scenes keep their bake and only get the backdrop.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Weather</strong></td><td>Rain streaks or snowflakes falling around the visitor; rain also wets upward-facing surfaces (darker, glossier).</td><td>WebGPU and WebGL2 (wet response: streamed scenes on both, classic GLBs on WebGPU).</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Fog</strong></td><td>Height fog — dense at a chosen height, thinning above — in a colour of your choice.</td><td>WebGPU and WebGL2.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ground</strong></td><td>A grass / asphalt / sand / custom-coloured plane under and around the model, sun-shadowed, fading to the horizon; or a heightfield (a PNG you upload) with real relief. <strong>Walkable</strong>: visitors stand on it.</td><td>WebGPU and WebGL2.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"try-it-in-a-link\">Try it in a link<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#try-it-in-a-link\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every knob is a share-string, so you can preview without saving:</p>\n<div class=\"doc-code\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code>/?vpk=ingest/&lt;id&gt;.vpk&amp;sun=140,25,3&amp;sky=3,1,0.4,0.6\n/?vpk=ingest/&lt;id&gt;.vpk&amp;sky=2.5&amp;weather=rain,0.7,2&amp;fog=0.02,0,8fa3bf,0.2\n/?vpk=ingest/&lt;id&gt;.vpk&amp;sky=4,1,0.8,0.7&amp;weather=snow,0.5,1&amp;ground=grass,120</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Knob</th><th>Values</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>sky=</code></td><td><code>turbidity,exposure,coverage,density[,atmosphere[,aerial]]</code> — turbidity 1 (alpine) … 10 (hazy), exposure around 1, cloud coverage and density 0–1. A bare <code>sky</code> turns it on with defaults; <code>sky=0</code> off. The optional <code>atmosphere</code> picks the clear-sky atmosphere model instead of Preetham (deeper blue overhead, a thin pale horizon, warm glow round the sun, warm sunlight); <code>aerial</code> (0–8, 1 = clear air) then hazes distance the way real air does. Big exteriors (township-scale sites) open with <code>atmosphere,1</code> by default.</td></tr><tr><td><code>weather=</code></td><td><code>rain|snow|none,intensity,windX[,windZ]</code> — intensity 0–1, wind in m/s.</td></tr><tr><td><code>fog=</code></td><td><code>density,height,rrggbb[,falloff]</code> — density 0.005 (a hint) … 0.1 (thick), height in metres, falloff how fast it thins above. <code>fog=0</code> off.</td></tr><tr><td><code>ground=</code></td><td><code>grass|asphalt|sand|rrggbb,size[,y]</code> — size in metres (default 60), <code>y</code> the ground height (default: just under the model). <code>ground=none</code> off. Heightfields come from the saved experience, not the link.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>The Sun panel&#39;s <code>?sun=</code> sets where the sun is; the sky follows it.</p>\n<h2 id=\"author-it-and-save-it\">Author it and save it<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#author-it-and-save-it\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>Open the scene as its owner with <code>?author=1</code> (a signed-in Studio\nsession). Beside <strong>Sun</strong> in the toolbar there is <strong>Exterior</strong>.</li><li><strong>Sky</strong> — tick <em>on</em>, drag turbidity (crisp → hazy), exposure, clouds.\nMove the sun in the Sun panel and watch the dome and the ambient follow.</li><li><strong>Weather</strong> — pick rain or snow, set intensity and wind. Rain darkens\nand polishes floors and roofs; walls stay dry.</li><li><strong>Fog</strong> — tick <em>on</em>, set density, the height it sits at, how fast it\nthins, and its colour.</li><li><strong>Ground</strong> — pick <em>plane</em>, a material and a size; leave <em>Height y</em>\nempty to sit just under the model. For relief, pick a PNG (≤ 4096 ×\n4096, the red channel is the height, white = <code>Relief</code> metres up),\npress <strong>Upload</strong>, and the kind switches to <em>heightfield</em>. Click\n<strong>Walk</strong> — you are standing on it.</li><li>In the Author bar tick **Save the exterior (sky, weather, fog, ground)\nwith this experience<strong>, press </strong>Save<strong>, then </strong>Set as link default**.\nThe plain share link now opens with your exterior; the link also\ncarries the knobs while you work, so a copied URL previews the same\nlook.</li></ol>\n<p>The heightfield lives beside the scene as <code>ingest/&lt;id&gt;.ground.png</code> (API:\n<code>PUT /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;/ground</code>, SDK: <code>scenes.setGround</code>) and follows the\nscene&#39;s visibility and version rules.</p>\n<h2 id=\"embeds\">Embeds<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#embeds\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"js\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy-2\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-js\">const viewer = Verse.embed(el, { scene: &quot;&lt;id&gt;&quot;, exterior: { sky: &quot;3,1,0.4,0.6&quot;, ground: &quot;grass,120&quot; } });\nviewer.on(&quot;exterior&quot;, (e) =&gt; console.log(e.state.sky, e.query));\nviewer.setExterior({ weather: { kind: &quot;rain&quot;, intensity: 0.6 } });\nviewer.setExterior(null); // everything off</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"good-to-know\">Good to know<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#good-to-know\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><strong>Baked scenes.</strong> A lightmapped scene keeps its own light; the sky is a\nbackdrop there, and the ground is still lit live. For a sky-lit look,\nbake with the sun you want, or upload the live-lit file.</li><li><strong>Interiors.</strong> Rain and snow fall through roofs (the sheet has no\ncollision) — leave weather at <code>none</code> inside, or use fog alone.</li><li><strong>Clouds</strong> are a 2D layer: they move and light with the sun but cast no\nshadows on the ground.</li><li><strong>Ground</strong> is one square; it receives the sun&#39;s shadow but casts none,\nand it fades to the horizon rather than ending at an edge.</li><li><strong>WebGL2</strong> draws everything; its classic-GLB meshes (not streamed scenes)\nskip the wet response.</li><li>Values are clamped engine-side; a link with a junk knob still renders.</li></ul>\n<p>Gate: <code>web/test/fix-verify-exterior.mjs</code> (ports 8870–8879).</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/exteriors\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#what-you-get\" id=\"lnk-what-you-get\">What you get</a><a href=\"#try-it-in-a-link\" id=\"lnk-try-it-in-a-link\">Try it in a link</a><a href=\"#author-it-and-save-it\" id=\"lnk-author-it-and-save-it\">Author it and save it</a><a href=\"#embeds\" id=\"lnk-embeds\">Embeds</a><a href=\"#good-to-know\" id=\"lnk-good-to-know\">Good to know</a></aside></section>"}